  "authority_rules": [
    "Deutsche Post Direkt delivery assignments and BKG PLZ surfaces establish postal authority; municipality or administrative boundaries do not.",
    "BKG PLZ geometry is a generalized cartographic surface for delivery postcodes and is not exact street, house, building or cadastral geometry.",
    "Large-recipient, P.O. box, organization and other codes without a delivery surface receive no buffer, Voronoi cell, administrative proxy or AGID-cell surface.",
    "Austrian postcodes routed through Germany remain Austrian identity and receive no German sovereignty claim.",
    "The public compatibility ZIP is test-only and never substitutes for the current nationwide licensed release.",
    "Exact address or building display requires a separate source-defined address/building relation."
